35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The morning routine takes up to nine minutes. That is a lot of lost time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The empty desks cost us 41,000 yen a month. We are paying for space we don't use.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives only four desks windows.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. My chair takes days to adjust properly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The new joiners learned by overhearing. If we sit apart, we lose that knowledge.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we pay for empty space, maybe we should consolidate?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk. Moving is expensive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the noise is bad, we should put you by the window.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I need a quiet spot. The window side is better for my focus.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if we group by function, we might lose the cross-talk that helps new people.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I think we need a system that minimizes daily setup time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I think we need to stop paying for unused space.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I think we need to be fair about who gets the good seats.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,I think we need to prioritize comfort and noise levels.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I think we need to keep people close enough to talk.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
